{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01632",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.52,
      "end_seconds": 4.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Ah, hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.06,
      "end_seconds": 9.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.14,
      "end_seconds": 15.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Well, uh, I've been having an itchy scalp."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.66,
      "end_seconds": 19.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.89,
      "end_seconds": 25.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "well, it's been five days, I'm fairly sure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.09,
      "end_seconds": 29.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "I follow. Is it constant or in episodes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.97,
      "end_seconds": 35.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "I mean, it sort of comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.72,
      "end_seconds": 38.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "understood. Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.96,
      "end_seconds": 41.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "Moderate, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.89,
      "end_seconds": 46.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "any scratch marks on the neck as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.75,
      "end_seconds": 62.7,
      "duration_seconds": 14.95,
      "text": "yes, actually. With scratch marks on the neck, mild, I'd say. Actually, you know, I had seeing tiny bugs in the hair before. That's settled now, though"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.29,
      "end_seconds": 80.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "any fever, rash on the body or swollen glands at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.3,
      "end_seconds": 87.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "Um, uh, no, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.74,
      "end_seconds": 92.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.22,
      "end_seconds": 97.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.39,
      "end_seconds": 109.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.76,
      "end_seconds": 123.18,
      "duration_seconds": 12.42,
      "text": "Pantoprazole i take it 40 milligrams, before breakfast for my acidity though honestly, some days I forget to take it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.85,
      "end_seconds": 126.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.16,
      "end_seconds": 137.37,
      "duration_seconds": 9.21,
      "text": "I have acid reflux, for about a year. I've had anxiety for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.11,
      "end_seconds": 142.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "what line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.25,
      "end_seconds": 150.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.26,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.15,
      "end_seconds": 154.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.69,
      "end_seconds": 159.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.99,
      "end_seconds": 173.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Right, what operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.59,
      "end_seconds": 185.59,
      "duration_seconds": 10.0,
      "text": "Just a mole taken off my arm, a few years ago. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.52,
      "end_seconds": 190.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.56,
      "end_seconds": 197.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "yes, erythromycin. I get a rash"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.44,
      "end_seconds": 201.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.79,
      "end_seconds": 209.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.23,
      "text": "My daughter has type 1 diabetes. Okay, so my cousin has psoriasis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.2,
      "end_seconds": 212.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.86,
      "end_seconds": 223.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.18,
      "end_seconds": 245.21,
      "duration_seconds": 10.03,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 98 percent, temperature is 36.6 degrees, pulse is 68 beats a minute, BP is 122 over 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.79,
      "end_seconds": 247.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.55,
      "end_seconds": 251.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.39,
      "end_seconds": 257.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.16,
      "end_seconds": 261.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "take a deep breath for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.28,
      "end_seconds": 281.57,
      "duration_seconds": 7.29,
      "text": "I can see live lice and small eggs close to the roots behind the ears."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.92,
      "end_seconds": 286.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.08,
      "end_seconds": 320.21,
      "duration_seconds": 30.13,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. Taking everything into account, the most likely explanation is head lice. What I'm giving you is dimeticone lotion, 4%, once, repeat after seven days, two applications. It's for head lice. Comb the hair with a fine comb every few days and check the family. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.34,
      "end_seconds": 326.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.79,
      "end_seconds": 329.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.37,
      "end_seconds": 335.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Let's plan a a check if lice persist after two treatments."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 336.46,
      "end_seconds": 339.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "I can put that appointment in for you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.51,
      "end_seconds": 344.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 345.38,
      "end_seconds": 349.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.25,
      "end_seconds": 353.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}